Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:07.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.93,0:00:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,awesome treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.84,0:00:20.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hidden at the end of the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.23,0:00:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and anyone who finds it,\Nthe King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.95,0:00:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that exciting or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.49,0:00:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are incredible adventures\Nout there just waiting for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.05,0:00:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage, have the courage\Nthat sail and believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.61,0:00:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we will see a glimpse of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.27,0:00:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sun rising on our tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Video Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.25,0:00:50.43,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}fedew\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.37,0:00:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when we first started,\Nwe had separate horizons,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.85,0:00:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sailed toward different dreams.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Graphics
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.80,0:00:55.72,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Datenshi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.99,0:00:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have changed now, for together we\Nfound we look through the spyglass and see.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(540,579)\fscx100\fscy100\bord3}Quality Control
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.81,0:01:01.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(583.02,619.65)}Gab\NGalaxy 9000\NGol D. Rocks\NPepperjack\NWestfal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.97,0:01:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we know that our hearts\Nhave brought us here.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.06,0:01:07.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.57,0:01:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the conscious point's our destiny.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.82,0:01:11.82,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.99,0:01:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no looking back,\Ntake the hell with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.99,0:01:15.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bon voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.15,0:01:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't stop all our troubles,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.37,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,forget the past Though the future's\Nunclear, we still can smile.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\pos(86.67,119)\bord3}Timing/Typesetting
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.83,0:01:27.46,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(129.69,159.65)}Gab
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know we'll get there, no regrets!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(24,113)}Subtitle Editing
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.46,0:01:31.51,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(67.02,153.65)}CraigyBoi\NPollychan\NZenef
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.49,0:01:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every tear that we've cried\Nonly helps our dreams come true.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx100\fscy100\bord3\pos(964,111.4)}Translation
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.59,0:01:37.06,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fscx120\fscy120\pos(1007.02,152.05)}DemonRin\NFunimation
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.37,0:01:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and those dreams\Nare precious in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.57,0:01:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A glimpse of the sun\Nrising on our tomorrow?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.11,0:01:54.49,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\c&H181818&\3c&H181818&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(479,481)\t(437,479,\1a&H00&)\t(3899,3941,\1a&HFF&)}Love Song
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.11,0:01:54.49,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HE5E6E6&\4a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(479,481)}Love Song
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.11,0:01:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, Eneru's been up there for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.41,0:01:56.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have taken the Golden Bell by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.85,0:02:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard you stretch your arms,\Nthere's no way you can reach up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.91,0:02:03.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he took it, I'm gonna take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.09,0:02:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me the waiver!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.21,0:02:22.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even Heaven's Gate was blown\Naway in the twinkling of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.73,0:02:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angel Island, it's completely destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.03,0:02:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.65,0:02:29.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And where do we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.09,0:02:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To Cloud End, and then down to the\NBlue Sea, like Captain McKinley said.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.89,0:02:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our only choice. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.11,0:02:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still a lot of people in the White\NWhite Sea who haven't been evacuated yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.69,0:02:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Milky Roads leading\Nthere have been destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.95,0:02:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.86,0:02:44.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how we can bring\Nthose ships down without them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.07,0:02:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, you're saying we just\Nleave those people to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.37,0:03:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.31,0:03:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The White White Sea is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.07,0:03:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.33,0:03:17.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fading away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.07,0:03:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Splendid!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.17,0:03:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last, the Grand Belfry that was once the\Npride of the legendary city of Shandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.55,0:03:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.41,0:03:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A prize befitting a god\Nof my power and glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.29,0:03:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fabled Belle,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.75,0:03:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the one that heralded the start of\Nthis land's 400-year-old conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.37,0:04:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.53,0:04:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's falling towards\Nus again! Wait. Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.69,0:04:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A leaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.47,0:04:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's it say? Cut down this beanstalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.63,0:04:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and make sure it falls towards the west
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.33,0:04:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what'll happen if we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.65,0:04:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've accomplished all of my\Nobjectives but one, so now...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.21,0:05:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time I destroyed this\Npathetic land and the cumuloregalus
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.85,0:05:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,clouds it rests on and set\Noff for the endless birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm actually going to miss\Ntoying with the Skypians' lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.99,0:05:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.57,0:05:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.95,0:05:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.77,0:05:26.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one's even bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.71,0:05:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.31,0:05:34.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While there's still some place to get!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.09,0:05:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye, Skypiea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.25,0:05:48.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's even bigger than his last one!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.33,0:05:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.29,0:05:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that he's got his grubby\Nhands on the golden bell,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he has no more use for Skypiea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.83,0:05:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let him get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.83,0:05:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:05:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But weren't you gonna escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.47,0:06:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I can't leave\Nnow with what's at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.99,0:06:06.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, you want to ring\Nthat golden bell, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.73,0:06:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've gotta!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.69,0:06:08.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For old-timer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.45,0:06:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But with your arm, you\Ncan't drive the waiver.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I left you here, you'd\Nkeep trying to jump up,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.19,0:06:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so leave the driving to me\Nand I'll get you up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.31,0:06:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.07,0:06:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to promise that you'll get\Nus out of this mess in one piece, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.87,0:06:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got it. And thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.81,0:06:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've only got one chance\Nto get this thing right
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.73,0:06:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hope they got my\Nmessage and Understand
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.97,0:06:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what we're attempting\Nto do Let me get this
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.41,0:06:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,straight they're gonna\Njump to The ark from the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.33,0:06:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,falling beanstalk you\Ngot any better ideas well
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.35,0:06:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's crazy they can't\NBe serious then I'll leave
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.15,0:06:56.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it to you to climb up\Nthere and stop luffy he
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.25,0:07:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,won't listen look I don't\Ncare how crazy it sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.19,0:07:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.21,0:07:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to let him do this
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.17,0:07:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we stay here, we're just gonna\Nget pushed down to the ruins below?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.47,0:07:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.87,0:07:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from the beanstalk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.09,0:07:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.19,0:07:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I need to do is cut the vine\Ndown towards that ship right but
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.11,0:07:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That maniac is about\Nto wipe this land away,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.47,0:07:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and there are only two people who can\Nreach him before he sets that thing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.81,0:07:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.91,0:07:33.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami and Luffy, you better get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.21,0:07:40.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's far too late to change things now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.27,0:07:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The minute you enter the survival\Ngame, your fates were cast in stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.79,0:07:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything you do is futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.05,0:07:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, he's going to be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.41,0:07:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro buddy, you're the\Nonly one who can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.61,0:07:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.43,0:08:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eneru, I am so sick of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.07,0:08:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.21,0:08:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.51,0:08:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.37,0:08:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Insolent little worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.99,0:08:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it and got zapped,\Nbut he did it! Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.67,0:08:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The vine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.43,0:08:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The vine's not falling but he cut
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:08:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it what is that thing made out of it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.19,0:09:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,looks like a plant but it's Solid\Nas a rock pathetic this is what you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.53,0:09:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,outsiders get for butting in\Nwhatever what are you doing Quiet we
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.59,0:09:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shandians are the descendants of\Nkalgara not that kid in the Straw Hat
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.43,0:09:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anyone is to ring that bell,\Nit should rightfully be us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.81,0:09:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to him, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.07,0:09:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too banged up to stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.57,0:09:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, Nami and Luffy\Nare counting on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.49,0:09:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our only priority right now\Nis knocking that thing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.61,0:09:30.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, Zoro's already\Ncut through half of the stem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.89,0:09:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It probably wouldn't take too much\Nto cut through the rest of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.35,0:09:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My awesome dance of the exploding\Nstars should do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.95,0:09:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After just one little hit, even a gentle\Nbreeze will knock that thing over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.85,0:09:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once again, it's up to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.65,0:09:48.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last line of defense\Nin our merry band.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.25,0:09:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, leave all the\Ndangerous stuff to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.15,0:09:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You tend to our fallen comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.39,0:09:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They look like an Alto\Nleaf mochi cake. Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.47,0:10:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About that bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.01,0:10:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four hundred years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.37,0:10:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an explorer from my world said\Nhe stumbled upon a city of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.55,0:10:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People laughed at him\Nand called him a liar,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.73,0:10:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he has a descendant today\Nwho still believes the stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.61,0:10:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and has spent years searching the Blue\NSea for any evidence of the City of Gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.31,0:10:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that golden bell can be rung,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.77,0:10:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,everyone will know the City of\NGold is in the sky and not a myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.57,0:10:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the reason Luffy's up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.41,0:10:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now do you understand,\NExploding Star? Noble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.37,0:10:48.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,isn't it trying to vindicate\Na man he never met?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.95,0:10:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's had chances to escape, but he's\Nstuck around to see this thing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.29,0:10:56.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy's nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.05,0:10:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barrel Exploding Star?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.85,0:11:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp Rubberband of Doom?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.23,0:11:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regular Exploding Star?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.33,0:11:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.09,0:11:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the name of this\Nexplorer's descendant?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.29,0:11:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mont Blanc Cricket Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.61,0:11:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name of his ancestor who came here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me, was it Noland?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.13,0:11:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.43,0:11:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.43,0:11:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on, Wiper?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.19,0:11:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.27,0:11:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this a sign from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.71,0:11:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or a miracle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, Great Warrior Kalgara?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.79,0:11:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come, Nola.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.21,0:11:57.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll ring the bell again today so the\Nsound reaches the ends of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.75,0:12:01.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's send the sound you love to\Nsay hello to our friend Noland.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What just did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.53,0:12:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess it doesn't matter because it\Ncouldn't even budge that beanstalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.57,0:12:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe one of my triple explosions\Nwill do the trick. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.03,0:13:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reject!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.37,0:13:13.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.23,0:13:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.45,0:13:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.89,0:13:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A reject dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.87,0:13:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now fall, Giant Jack. Fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.71,0:13:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, we've got to run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.89,0:13:41.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.37,0:13:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get on, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.03,0:13:44.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gun it! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.89,0:13:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should mention,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.33,0:13:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never revved this Waver's jet\Ndial up to maximum power before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.05,0:13:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was a little scared to\Nsee how fast it would go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.77,0:13:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we're gonna find out now if it'll\Nbe too strong for me to control, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.99,0:14:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go for it, Nami! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.47,0:14:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Luffy! Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.63,0:14:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.59,0:14:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.53,0:14:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.07,0:14:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Nami, Luffy, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.29,0:14:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.73,0:14:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we let this place be destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.51,0:14:30.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll never get to ring that bell\Nand Cricket will never hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.37,0:14:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He helped us, so we gotta help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ring that bell and ring it loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.95,0:14:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jump to Anaru's ship and stop that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.71,0:14:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.05,0:14:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's up to you\Nguys now, you got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.83,0:14:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.49,0:14:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.97,0:15:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, why can't you wait for the completion\Nof Rick like the rest of the insects?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.37,0:15:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their impatience will be their undoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.59,0:15:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.45,0:15:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That you should even\Ntry to reach me now is
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.15,0:15:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,insulin far beyond the point of stupidity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.93,0:15:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now pay for your folly, ma-ma-ra-ga.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.93,0:15:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.97,0:15:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to destroy\Nthe base of the Beanstalk!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.01,0:15:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do something, Nami! Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.97,0:15:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going too fast\Nand we're too high up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.89,0:15:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this thing loses its foundation,\Nit'll crash before we get to the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.25,0:15:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't reach Enel and\Nwe'll fall to our death!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.81,0:15:56.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Upper yard's being pummeled!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.69,0:15:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.29,0:16:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lightning may not harm you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.23,0:16:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but your abilities are absolutely\Nuseless if you can't reach Maxim.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.97,0:16:17.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now fall and face destruction\Nwith the rest of Skypiea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.33,0:16:18.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.93,0:16:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The upper yard is crumbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.17,0:16:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.07,0:16:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.69,0:16:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I think he's trying to make\Nsure you don't get near him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.71,0:16:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad, he's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.15,0:16:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's destroying the cloud\Ncover over the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.91,0:17:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He plans to destroy the ground itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.07,0:17:08.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So is Zoro that bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.47,0:17:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't work, Enel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This city will never fall to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.47,0:17:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.03,0:17:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This land of Shandora was home\Nto a proud race of warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.07,0:17:43.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ancient city preserves\Nand protects their memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.93,0:17:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's more, their memory\Nprotects this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.15,0:17:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That mighty power will never fall to\Nyou, no matter how much forest you burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.31,0:18:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This land won't fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.23,0:18:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can still hear the little\Nfools whining down below.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.97,0:19:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The birth, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.55,0:19:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It didn't fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.77,0:19:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Upper Yard is still standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.13,0:19:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Its power is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.57,0:19:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.45,0:19:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The birth is so powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.11,0:19:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What fools we've been!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.93,0:19:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was never something to be fought over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.71,0:19:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've spilled so much blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.57,0:19:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And lost so many countless lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.51,0:19:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could we be so blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.15,0:19:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For 400 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.61,0:19:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.57,0:20:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wiper!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.59,0:20:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.71,0:20:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The beanstalk's coming down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.89,0:20:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.80,0:20:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.72,0:20:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.63,0:20:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.21,0:20:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.12,0:20:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw hatch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.17,0:20:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here I come, Enel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.27,0:20:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those fools never learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.27,0:20:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give back the golden bell right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.41,0:20:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.05,0:20:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.17,0:20:50.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now disappear along with this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.29,0:20:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.73,0:21:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, for your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.35,0:21:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.53,0:21:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.29,0:21:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Ark's over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.05,0:21:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.41,0:21:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.55,0:21:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The air current and lightning\Ndischarges in there could kill even you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.71,0:21:43.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you can do\Nagainst this kind of power?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.69,0:21:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man of rubber!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.51,0:22:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tang! SHOCK!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.65,0:22:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,SHOCK!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.35,0:22:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,FIREWORKS!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.63,0:22:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,GOLDEN PEONY!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.15,0:22:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, with your thunder and lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.75,0:22:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it all the way to Sky Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.09,0:22:46.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you had to come along\Nand ruin the weather,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.71,0:22:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you electrical freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.61,0:22:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with all the crazy lightning bolts?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.83,0:22:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.74,0:23:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That gold ball stuck in his\Narm is a natural conductor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.17,0:23:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, I'll just drop it before\Nyou can discharge the electricity.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.49,0:23:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let everything be destroyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.33,0:23:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain McKinley, please stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.29,0:23:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is God's land.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.01,0:23:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.97,0:23:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if it's pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.23,0:23:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only thing people can do when\Nthey're caught between life and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.31,0:23:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.53,0:23:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've abandoned our\Nhome and chosen to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.53,0:23:37.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't go back, nor can we go forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.71,0:23:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Praying is all that we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.49,0:23:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The song of the island when our ears
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.61,0:23:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hear that again the war will have ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.37,0:24:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder are we all doomed maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.99,0:24:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if i'd had the courage to stand
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.91,0:24:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up to Enel. My friends would\Nhave been spared all this, oh Sue
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.49,0:24:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,does God exist
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.99,0:24:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if he does why
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.13,0:24:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't he save us? Please... if you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.77,0:24:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exist, you must protect those brave\Nsave people and keep them safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.23,0:24:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, give us a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.23,0:24:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect this land!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.47,0:24:39.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord God!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.93,0:25:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That mass of thunderclouds has vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.23,0:25:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.63,0:25:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.75,0:25:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.73,0:25:51.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now rig it, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.93,0:25:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Light the fire of Shandora!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.75,0:25:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Loopy! Go, Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.41,0:25:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me hear it, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.23,0:26:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The song of the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.13,0:26:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You destroyed my Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.65,0:26:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Insolent Blue Sea ape! You're next!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.55,0:26:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll ring you along with the bell!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.95,0:26:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impudent fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.45,0:26:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two hundred million volts!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.11,0:26:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ramaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.17,0:26:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.29,0:26:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ring the bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.85,0:26:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.97,0:26:36.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be one of those fools who\Nbelieves in the old legend that when
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.65,0:26:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the bell rings it will mean the end of\Nthe war between Skypiea and Shandora.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.39,0:26:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am God!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.57,0:26:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care how strong you are,\Nyou're still just a Paramecia type.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.33,0:26:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could never match the might of my\NLugia power, no matter how hard you try,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.17,0:27:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no matter what you might do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.43,0:27:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That won't work on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.47,0:27:09.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And quit calling yourself God!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.55,0:27:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of God destroys\Neverything and saves nothing? Fake!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.49,0:27:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well done, Rubberman.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.01,0:27:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was very agile of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.51,0:27:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You grabbed it before\Nyou could be impaled.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.41,0:27:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.69,0:27:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what will you do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.55,0:27:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have nowhere to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.27,0:27:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pull of the golden\Nball on your arm will
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.73,0:27:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,draw you deeper and\Ndeeper onto my trident.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.11,0:27:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you should let go,\Nyou'll fall to your death below.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.59,0:27:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admit I'm impressed\Nyou made it this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.71,0:27:55.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is the end for you,\Nboy. And this land. Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.39,0:27:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can easily create another Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.09,0:28:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the duty of every\Ncitizen here on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.45,0:28:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.75,0:28:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will the Sky Islands really be destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.01,0:28:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you prefer to fall, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.17,0:28:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.87,0:28:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.78,0:28:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.75,0:28:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.83,0:28:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.74,0:28:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should never mess with me, earlobes!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.09,0:28:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.33,0:28:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rocket!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.87,0:28:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.49,0:29:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to try that\Nsame old trick again?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.79,0:29:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep trying until the bell rings!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.73,0:29:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This time I'll skewer you, fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.99,0:29:09.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All day, my fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.21,0:29:14.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.89,0:29:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you finally return, what will\Nyou think when you see we're gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.85,0:29:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.11,0:29:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll let you know that we're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.47,0:29:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Noland!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.38,0:29:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Light the fire of Shandora!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.63,0:30:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The war in the sky began 400 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.79,0:30:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think I'd live\Nto see this moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.01,0:30:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, the Holy Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.67,0:30:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll sing once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.73,0:30:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.07,0:30:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Six years ago, on the island of Jaya and\Nthe Grand Line, I saw the City of Gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.27,0:30:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold does exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.69,0:31:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not one person in history has ever\Ndisproven the existence of Sky Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.51,0:31:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a romantic just like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.91,0:31:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let it rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.01,0:31:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pops!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.41,0:31:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.81,0:31:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The City of Gold is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.57,0:31:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For 400 years, The city of gold
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.03,0:31:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has been in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.99,0:32:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not just like the moon, you'll never\Nchange as you climb into the night!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.69,0:32:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your reflection wanes,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.57,0:32:13.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then you disappear fading so silently.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.43,0:32:20.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay as you are, don't lose your way,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.37,0:32:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let these words guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.69,0:32:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ever look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.21,0:32:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up on your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.61,0:32:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're windless nights,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.03,0:32:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they come to you All again and again\NUntil you see the journey through?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.67,0:32:43.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may not return.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.55,0:32:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope that you learn To put your
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.03,0:32:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,past behind And just keep moving on.

